<!doctype html>

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />

		<meta
			name="viewport"
			content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
	/>

		<meta
			name="description"
			content="Josh Maddox - Game Programmer portfolio featuring Unreal Engine, C++, Unity, Godot, gameplay systems, procedural environments, and game development projects."
	/>

		<title>Josh Maddox | Game Programmer</title>

		<link
			rel="icon"
			type="image/x-icon"
			href="/Portfoli/favicon.ico"
	/>


		<style is:inline="">

			/* =========================================================
			RESET
			========================================================= */

			* {
			box-sizing: border-box;
			margin: 0;
			padding: 0;
			}

			html {
			scroll-behavior: smooth;
			scroll-padding-top: 90px;
			}

			body {
			min-height: 100vh;

			background:
			radial-gradient(
			circle at top,
			#151922 0%,
			#0b0d11 45%,
			#07080b 100%
			);

			color: #f4f4f4;

			font-family:
			Arial,
			Helvetica,
			sans-serif;

			line-height: 1.6;

			overflow-x: hidden;
			}

			a {
			color: inherit;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			STAR BACKGROUND
			========================================================= */

			.star-background {
			position: fixed;

			inset: 0;

			z-index: 0;

			overflow: hidden;

			pointer-events: none;
			}

			.star {
			position: absolute;

			top: -20px;

			background: #ffffff;

			border-radius: 50%;

			opacity: 0;

			box-shadow:
			0 0 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);

			animation:
			fall linear infinite;
			}

			@keyframes fall {

			0% {
			transform: translateY(-40px);
			opacity: 0;
			}

			10% {
			opacity: var(--star-opacity);
			}

			80% {
			opacity: var(--star-opacity);
			}

			100% {
			transform: translateY(110vh);
			opacity: 0;
			}
			}


			/* =========================================================
			PAGE LAYERS
			========================================================= */

			header,
			main,
			footer {
			position: relative;
			z-index: 2;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			NAVIGATION
			========================================================= */

			header {
			position: sticky;

			top: 0;

			z-index: 100;

			background:
			rgba(
			8,
			10,
			13,
			0.90
			);

			backdrop-filter: blur(12px);

			border-bottom: 1px solid #272b33;
			}

			nav {
			width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));

			margin: 0 auto;

			min-height: 76px;

			display: flex;

			align-items: center;

			justify-content: space-between;
			}

			.logo {
			font-size: 20px;

			font-weight: 700;

			text-decoration: none;
			}

			.nav-links {
			display: flex;

			gap: 28px;
			}

			.nav-links a {
			color: #aeb3bb;

			text-decoration: none;

			font-size: 15px;

			transition: color 0.2s ease;
			}

			.nav-links a:hover {
			color: #ffffff;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			GENERAL
			========================================================= */

			main {
			width:
			min(
			1180px,
			calc(100% - 40px)
			);

			margin: 0 auto;
			}

			section {
			padding: 110px 0;
			}

			.section-label {
			margin-bottom: 12px;

			color: #8d949f;

			font-size: 12px;

			font-weight: 700;

			letter-spacing: 4px;
			}

			.section-title {
			margin-bottom: 20px;

			font-size:
			clamp(
			38px,
			6vw,
			56px
			);

			line-height: 1.05;
			}

			.section-description {
			max-width: 720px;

			margin-bottom: 45px;

			color: #a9afb8;

			font-size: 17px;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			HERO
			========================================================= */

			.hero {
			min-height: calc(100vh - 76px);

			display: flex;

			flex-direction: column;

			justify-content: center;
			}

			.hero-label {
			margin-bottom: 16px;

			color: #9198a3;

			font-size: 13px;

			font-weight: 700;

			letter-spacing: 5px;
			}

			.hero h1 {
			margin-bottom: 18px;

			font-size:
			clamp(
			64px,
			10vw,
			118px
			);

			line-height: 0.92;

			letter-spacing: -4px;
			}

			.hero h2 {
			margin-bottom: 24px;

			color: #c1c5cb;

			font-size:
			clamp(
			25px,
			4vw,
			36px
			);

			font-weight: 400;
			}

			.hero-description {
			max-width: 750px;

			color: #a8aeb7;

			font-size: 19px;
			}

			.hero-buttons {
			margin-top: 38px;

			display: flex;

			flex-wrap: wrap;

			gap: 14px;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			BUTTONS
			========================================================= */

			.button {
			display: inline-flex;

			align-items: center;

			justify-content: center;

			min-height: 46px;

			padding: 0 22px;

			border-radius: 6px;

			font-weight: 700;

			text-decoration: none;

			transition:
			transform 0.2s ease,
			background 0.2s ease,
			border-color 0.2s ease;
			}

			.button:hover {
			transform: translateY(-2px);
			}

			.button-primary {
			background: #f2f2f2;

			color: #0a0b0d;
			}

			.button-primary:hover {
			background: #d7d7d7;
			}

			.button-secondary {
			background:
			rgba(
			22,
			25,
			31,
			0.85
			);

			border: 1px solid #3b414b;

			color: #ffffff;
			}

			.button-secondary:hover {
			background: #20242b;

			border-color: #5a626e;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			PROJECT GRID
			========================================================= */

			.project-grid {
			display: grid;

			grid-template-columns:
			repeat(
			3,
			minmax(0, 1fr)
			);

			gap: 24px;

			align-items: start;
			}

			.project-card {
			background:
			linear-gradient(
			145deg,
			rgba(22, 25, 31, 0.96),
			rgba(13, 15, 19, 0.96)
			);

			border: 1px solid #2c3139;

			border-radius: 10px;

			overflow: hidden;

			box-shadow:
			0 18px 45px
			rgba(
			0,
			0,
			0,
			0.22
			);

			transition:
			transform 0.25s ease,
			border-color 0.25s ease;
			}

			.project-card:not([open]):hover {
			transform: translateY(-6px);

			border-color: #555d69;
			}

			.project-card[open] {
			grid-column: 1 / -1;

			border-color: #606875;
			}

			.project-summary {
			display: block;

			padding: 18px;

			cursor: pointer;

			list-style: none;
			}

			.project-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
			display: none;
			}

			.project-summary::marker {
			content: "";
			}

			.project-image {
			height: 215px;

			margin-bottom: 20px;

			display: flex;

			align-items: center;

			justify-content: center;

			background:
			linear-gradient(
			135deg,
			#232833,
			#151820
			);

			border: 1px solid #303641;

			border-radius: 7px;

			color: #6f7782;

			font-size: 12px;

			font-weight: 700;

			letter-spacing: 2px;

			text-align: center;
			}

			.project-type {
			margin-bottom: 7px;

			color: #7f8792;

			font-size: 11px;

			font-weight: 700;

			letter-spacing: 3px;
			}

			.project-card h3 {
			margin-bottom: 5px;

			font-size: 26px;
			}

			.project-tech {
			margin-bottom: 16px;

			color: #7f8791;

			font-size: 13px;
			}

			.project-description {
			min-height: 82px;

			margin-bottom: 22px;

			color: #b6bbc2;

			font-size: 15px;
			}

			.project-open,
			.project-close {
			font-size: 14px;

			font-weight: 700;
			}

			.project-close {
			display: none;
			}

			.project-card[open] .project-open {
			display: none;
			}

			.project-card[open] .project-close {
			display: inline;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			EXPANDED PROJECT
			========================================================= */

			.project-details {
			padding: 60px 48px 70px;

			background:
			rgba(
			7,
			9,
			12,
			0.62
			);

			border-top: 1px solid #2b3038;

			animation: projectOpen 0.25s ease;
			}

			@keyframes projectOpen {

			from {
			opacity: 0;

			transform: translateY(-8px);
			}

			to {
			opacity: 1;

			transform: translateY(0);
			}
			}

			.detail-header {
			max-width: 850px;

			margin-bottom: 42px;
			}

			.detail-label {
			margin-bottom: 12px;

			color: #858d98;

			font-size: 12px;

			font-weight: 700;

			letter-spacing: 4px;
			}

			.detail-header h2 {
			margin-bottom: 20px;

			font-size:
			clamp(
			46px,
			8vw,
			76px
			);

			line-height: 0.98;
			}

			.detail-header p {
			color: #b3b8c0;

			font-size: 18px;
			}

			.hero-media {
			height: 500px;

			margin-bottom: 70px;

			display: flex;

			align-items: center;

			justify-content: center;

			background:
			linear-gradient(
			135deg,
			#171b22,
			#0f1217
			);

			border: 1px solid #303640;

			border-radius: 10px;

			color: #686f79;

			font-size: 13px;

			font-weight: 700;

			letter-spacing: 2px;
			}

			.detail-section {
			margin-bottom: 70px;
			}

			.detail-section:last-child {
			margin-bottom: 0;
			}

			.detail-section h3 {
			margin-bottom: 24px;

			font-size: 32px;
			}

			.detail-section > p {
			max-width: 850px;

			margin-bottom: 16px;

			color: #afb4bc;

			font-size: 17px;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			CONTRIBUTIONS
			========================================================= */

			.contribution-grid {
			display: grid;

			grid-template-columns:
			repeat(
			2,
			minmax(0, 1fr)
			);

			gap: 18px;
			}

			.contribution {
			padding: 24px;

			background:
			linear-gradient(
			145deg,
			#171a20,
			#111318
			);

			border: 1px solid #2d323a;

			border-radius: 8px;
			}

			.contribution h4 {
			margin-bottom: 9px;

			font-size: 20px;
			}

			.contribution p {
			color: #9fa5ae;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			TAGS
			========================================================= */

			.tags {
			display: flex;

			flex-wrap: wrap;

			gap: 10px;
			}

			.tags span {
			padding: 9px 14px;

			background: #15181e;

			border: 1px solid #303640;

			border-radius: 5px;

			color: #c7cbd1;

			font-size: 14px;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			CODE
			========================================================= */

			.code-grid {
			display: grid;

			grid-template-columns:
			repeat(
			2,
			minmax(0, 1fr)
			);

			gap: 20px;
			}

			.code-card {
			overflow: hidden;

			background: #080a0d;

			border: 1px solid #303640;

			border-radius: 8px;
			}

			.code-title {
			padding: 12px 16px;

			display: flex;

			align-items: center;

			justify-content: space-between;

			background: #171a20;

			border-bottom: 1px solid #303640;

			color: #b6bbc2;

			font-size: 12px;
			}

			.code-card pre {
			min-height: 235px;

			margin: 0;

			padding: 24px;

			overflow-x: auto;

			color: #d9dde2;
			}

			.code-card code {
			font-family:
			Consolas,
			"Courier New",
			monospace;

			font-size: 13px;

			line-height: 1.7;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			SCREENSHOTS
			========================================================= */

			.media-grid {
			display: grid;

			grid-template-columns:
			repeat(
			2,
			minmax(0, 1fr)
			);

			gap: 18px;
			}

			.media-box {
			height: 290px;

			display: flex;

			align-items: center;

			justify-content: center;

			background:
			linear-gradient(
			135deg,
			#171b22,
			#101319
			);

			border: 1px solid #303640;

			border-radius: 8px;

			color: #656c76;

			font-size: 12px;

			font-weight: 700;

			letter-spacing: 2px;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			SKILLS
			========================================================= */

			.skill-layout {
			display: grid;

			grid-template-columns:
			repeat(
			2,
			minmax(0, 1fr)
			);

			gap: 20px;
			}

			.skill-card {
			padding: 28px;

			background:
			rgba(
			19,
			22,
			27,
			0.88
			);

			border: 1px solid #2c3139;

			border-radius: 8px;
			}

			.skill-card h3 {
			margin-bottom: 18px;

			font-size: 22px;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			ABOUT
			========================================================= */

			.about-card {
			max-width: 850px;

			padding: 36px;

			background:
			rgba(
			19,
			22,
			27,
			0.88
			);

			border: 1px solid #2c3139;

			border-radius: 8px;
			}

			.about-card p {
			margin-bottom: 18px;

			color: #afb4bc;

			font-size: 18px;
			}

			.about-card p:last-child {
			margin-bottom: 0;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			CONTACT
			========================================================= */

			.contact-card {
			padding: 40px;

			display: flex;

			align-items: center;

			justify-content: space-between;

			gap: 30px;

			background:
			rgba(
			19,
			22,
			27,
			0.88
			);

			border: 1px solid #2c3139;

			border-radius: 8px;
			}

			.contact-card h3 {
			margin-bottom: 8px;

			font-size: 26px;
			}

			.contact-card p {
			color: #9fa5ae;
			}


			/* =========================================================
			FOOTER
			========================================================= */

			footer {
			padding: 42px 20px;

			text-align: center;

			color: #686f79;

			border-top: 1px solid #242931;

			background:
			rgba(
			7,
			9,
			12,
			0.78
			);
			}


			/* =========================================================
			RESPONSIVE
			========================================================= */

			@media (max-width: 900px) {

			.project-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}

			.project-card[open] {
			grid-column: auto;
			}

			.contribution-grid,
			.code-grid,
			.media-grid,
			.skill-layout {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}

			.hero-media {
			height: 340px;
			}

			.project-description {
			min-height: auto;
			}
			}


			@media (max-width: 700px) {

			.nav-links {
			display: none;
			}

			.hero h1 {
			letter-spacing: -2px;
			}

			.project-details {
			padding: 45px 22px 55px;
			}

			.hero-media {
			height: 270px;
			}

			.media-box {
			height: 230px;
			}

			.contact-card {
			flex-direction: column;

			align-items: flex-start;
			}
			}


			@media (max-width: 500px) {

			main {
			width:
			min(
			100% - 28px,
			1180px
			);
			}

			nav {
			width:
			min(
			100% - 28px,
			1180px
			);
			}

			section {
			padding: 80px 0;
			}

			.hero h1 {
			font-size: 54px;
			}

			.hero-buttons {
			flex-direction: column;

			align-items: flex-start;
			}
			}

		</style>

	</head>


	<body>


		<!-- =========================================================
	     STAR BACKGROUND
	========================================================= -->

		<div
			id="star-background"
			class="star-background"
	></div>



		<!-- =========================================================
	     NAVIGATION
	========================================================= -->

		<header>

			<nav>

				<a
					class="logo"
					href="#home"
			>
					Josh Maddox
				</a>


				<div class="nav-links">

					<a href="#home">
						Home
					</a>

					<a href="#projects">
						Projects
					</a>

					<a href="#skills">
						Skills
					</a>

					<a href="#about">
						About
					</a>

					<a href="#contact">
						Contact
					</a>

				</div>

			</nav>

		</header>



		<main>


			<!-- =====================================================
		     HERO
		===================================================== -->

			<section
				id="home"
				class="hero"
		>

				<p class="hero-label">
					GAME PROGRAMMER
				</p>


				<h1>
					Josh Maddox
				</h1>


				<h2>
					Game Programmer
				</h2>


				<p class="hero-description">

					I create gameplay systems, technical tools,
					procedural environments, and interactive experiences
					using Unreal Engine, C++, Unity, and Godot.

				</p>


				<div class="hero-buttons">

					<a
						class="button button-primary"
						href="#projects"
				>
						View Projects
					</a>


					<a
						class="button button-secondary"
						href="https://github.com/Josh-Maddox"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>
						GitHub
					</a>

				</div>

			</section>



			<!-- =====================================================
		     PROJECTS
		===================================================== -->

			<section id="projects">

				<p class="section-label">
					SELECTED WORK
				</p>


				<h2 class="section-title">
					Featured Projects
				</h2>


				<p class="section-description">

					Select a project to expand it and view the full
					project breakdown, contributions, code examples,
					tools, and screenshots.

				</p>



				<div class="project-grid">


					<!-- =================================================
				     ASHEN BLOOM
				================================================= -->

					<details class="project-card">

						<summary class="project-summary">


							<div class="project-image">

								ASHEN BLOOM IMAGE

							</div>


							<p class="project-type">
								UNREAL ENGINE 5.6
							</p>


							<h3>
								Ashen Bloom
							</h3>


							<p class="project-tech">
								C++ • Blueprints • PCG
							</p>


							<p class="project-description">

								A third-person character-action
								souls-lite set in a dying world
								where nature has fused with machines,
								corpses, and ruined cities.

							</p>


							<span class="project-open">
								View Project →
							</span>


							<span class="project-close">
								Collapse Project ↑
							</span>


						</summary>



						<div class="project-details">


							<div class="detail-header">

								<p class="detail-label">
									UNREAL ENGINE 5.6
								</p>


								<h2>
									Ashen Bloom
								</h2>


								<p>

									Ashen Bloom is a single-player
									third-person character-action
									souls-lite set in a dying world where
									nature has fused with machines,
									corpses, and ruined cities.

								</p>

							</div>



							<div class="hero-media">

								ASHEN BLOOM GAMEPLAY IMAGE / VIDEO

							</div>



							<div class="detail-section">

								<h3>
									Project Overview
								</h3>


								<p>

									Ashen Bloom was developed collaboratively
									using Unreal Engine 5.6.

								</p>


								<p>

									My work focused on player systems,
									procedural environment development,
									landscape tools, foliage systems,
									and technical gameplay features.

								</p>

							</div>



							<div class="detail-section">

								<h3>
									My Contributions
								</h3>


								<div class="contribution-grid">


									<div class="contribution">

										<h4>
											Inventory System
										</h4>


										<p>

											Developed the player inventory
											system and its core functionality.

										</p>

									</div>



									<div class="contribution">

										<h4>
											Level-Up System
										</h4>


										<p>

											Created the player level-up
											system used for character
											progression.

										</p>

									</div>



									<div class="contribution">

										<h4>
											Inventory Character View
										</h4>


										<p>

											Implemented the rotating player
											character view used inside the
											inventory interface.

